@startuml
title SD-B06 Lupa Password

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Pengguna" as Pengguna
boundary "Halaman Login" as HalamanLogin
boundary "Halaman Lupa Password" as HalamanLupa
boundary "Form Email Reset" as FormEmail
control "PasswordResetLinkController" as ResetLinkController
control "MailService" as MailService
entity "Users Model" as User
entity "PasswordResetToken" as ResetToken

Pengguna -> HalamanLogin : Klik lupa password
HalamanLogin -> HalamanLupa : tampilkan halaman lupa password
HalamanLupa --> Pengguna : form email reset tampil
Pengguna -> FormEmail : Mengisi email
Pengguna -> FormEmail : Klik kirim link reset
FormEmail -> ResetLinkController : store(email)
ResetLinkController -> ResetLinkController : validasi format email

alt Email valid dan terdaftar
    ResetLinkController -> User : cari user berdasarkan email
    User --> ResetLinkController : user object
    ResetLinkController -> ResetToken : buat token reset
    ResetToken --> ResetLinkController : token reset
    ResetLinkController -> MailService : kirim link reset
    MailService -> MailService : send reset link
    MailService --> MailService : email terkirim
    MailService --> ResetLinkController : status terkirim
    ResetLinkController --> HalamanLupa : tampilkan status link reset dikirim
    HalamanLupa --> Pengguna : tautan reset dikirim
else Email tidak valid / tidak terdaftar
    ResetLinkController --> FormEmail : tampilkan pesan error
    FormEmail --> Pengguna : permintaan reset ditolak
else Email gagal dikirim
    ResetLinkController --> HalamanLupa : tampilkan pesan gagal kirim email
    HalamanLupa --> Pengguna : reset gagal
end

@enduml
